{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/pulls/8","id":4823485923,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVB4h8c8AAAABH4CN4w","html_url":"https://github.com/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/pull/8","diff_url":"https://github.com/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/pull/8.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/pull/8.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/issues/8","number":8,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Integrate C++ Mock bringup and ROS Web UI; document cancel boundary","user":{"login":"AfonsoZhang","id":194327208,"node_id":"U_kgDOC5UyqA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194327208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang","html_url":"https://github.com/AfonsoZhang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AfonsoZhang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"新增统一的 C++ Mock Task/PickPlace 启动入口与明确标注的 ROS Web UI。网页通过实际 ExecuteTask Action 调用 C++ Task，再由已有 C++ ActionClient 调用 PickPlace；带命名空间、就绪/冲突检查、父子 UUID 日志、退出清理和 SOP。\n\n候选基于截止时 main `f7eaa2c0d2887aeada4fd635112c63c237962ff7`，交付提交 `7da43228d602a6b23571bfc599d69529ef7bea23`。没有合并其他功能分支，FSM、ActionSlot、Motion Execution、接口 IDL 均未改动。\n\n验证：独立 Jazzy 容器，无外部网络/设备/宿主挂载/Docker 端口映射，2 CPU / 4 GiB。40 个 C++ Action 用例通过（colcon 含包装项 44），39 项离线 UI 检查通过；六个实际 HTTP→ROS→C++ 父子链路场景完成：基础/序列成功、及时 Cancel=CANCELED/0、预期 200/230/520 故障传播。浏览器已实际提交任务、展示反馈与终态，重复 C++ Server 时禁用提交并返回 409；停止/重启后核对图排空。\n\n**尚未通过 C1，交孙嘉明审阅**：正常 Mock、结果交付延时 700 ms 下，浏览器显示 MOVE_PRE_ALIGN 后点击取消，ACK 受理但最终父/子 ABORTED/520；观察到该状态后延迟 400 ms 的最小 CLI 复现得到同样结果。保留失败与正例，不放宽内核检查、不伪造取消成功。详见 `docs/migration/CPP_MOCK_WEBUI_REVIEW_20261012.md`。本 PR 不表示完整 FSM、MoveIt 或实机通过。\n\n[SOP](https://github.com/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/blob/7da43228d602a6b23571bfc599d69529ef7bea23/src/mtc_cpp_mock_bringup/README.md) · [验收报告与冻结索引](https://github.com/AfonsoZhang/meituan-robotics-challenge-2026/blob/6e040096986cdf0ea409943ae209d42507da7424/docs/cpp-mock-webui-acceptance.md)。\n\n同轮证据已实际推送个人仓库 `origin/main`：冻结归档提交 `23c33af62c8a69409dcfbaef96f4129067d7a678`，发布回执提交 `6e040096986cdf0ea409943ae209d42507da7424`。[953 文件冻结索引](https://github.com/AfonsoZhang/meituan-robotics-challenge-2026/blob/23c33af62c8a69409dcfbaef96f4129067d7a678/docs/experiments/cpp-mock-webui-20261012/index.json)，SHA-256 `0da681cc8ad09f6f75a5f88ea90b2fc19165d76f7960c1f6e0f64384799d7f22`；[机器可核验发布回执](https://github.com/AfonsoZhang/meituan-robotics-challenge-2026/blob/6e040096986cdf0ea409943ae209d42507da7424/docs/cpp-mock-webui-publication.json)。原始失败、14份历史签收报告及正式pin保持原字节。\n\n请求 F1u0rite 审阅；不自动合并，不推进个人项目的正式 FSM pin。Web UI 移入来源、哈希与 AI 协助范围已记入 provenance。\n","created_at":"2026-10-12T00:23:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:59:02Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e70c8a0f9e9bbaae4cd69e3a6479f2bb0427143a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"F1u0rite","id":46274026,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Mjc0MDI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46274026?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite","html_url":"https://github.com/F1u0rite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/s